---
import Layout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Anxiety Support & Counseling | Nepal Hypnosis" description="Professional guidance, coping strategies, and psychotherapy support for managing chronic anxiety, panic, and persistent worry in Kathmandu.">
  <main class="py-16 bg-[#FAF8F5]">
    <div class="container-nh max-w-4xl mx-auto bg-white p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-3xl shadow-sm border border-[#e2e8f0]">
      <span class="text-[11px] font-extrabold tracking-[0.2em] text-[#D84315] uppercase mb-3 block">Mental Well-being Insights</span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#173A7A] mb-6">Anxiety Support & Counseling</h1>
      
      <div class="prose max-w-none text-[#475569] space-y-6 leading-relaxed">
        <p class="text-lg font-medium text-[#173A7A]">
          Anxiety is more than temporary stress—it can feel like an exhausting, constant state of alarm that drains your emotional and physical energy.
        </p>
        <p>
          Whether you experience panic attacks, racing thoughts, health anxiety, or generalized worry, professional support helps you decode underlying triggers and build sustainable emotional regulation.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 bg-[#F5F1EA] p-6 rounded-2xl border border-[#e2e8f0]">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#173A7A] mb-2">Find Relief and Clarity</h3>
          <p class="text-sm mb-4">Connect with our experienced therapists for confidential anxiety support sessions.</p>
          <a href="https://portal.nepalhypnosis.com/form/consultation-request" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex rounded-xl bg-[#D84315] px-6 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-md hover:bg-[#b93812] transition">
            Request a Consultation →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>